{"parentUuid":"b35dd7cf-4400-4be5-8584-3d10ea2f3d86","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfxH2WmdJ5MhV7q1fPhfi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #148 is open: https://github.com/Vaibhaav-Tiwari/neatlogs-hack/pull/148. My direct message to you did not deliver, because your session is paused on a permission decision; I filed the same content as an AO report.\n\nWhat the PR changes:\n- **Measured comparison, judges 30% block:** your sentence, three bars ($1.22, $0.31, $0.43) with per-task costs, tiers and \"3 of 3 passed\", and every limit you listed printed beside it. No savings percentage appears.\n- **Extra limit I added:** in all three passes each task's first start failed with \"worker never started\" at $0.00 and was retried, and the ledgers show it. Say if you want that line removed.\n- **Compact version:** a three-bar figure under the five steps, with the sample size and a link to the full card.\n- **Cap and escalate:** `run-20261012-100856Z` now leads — stopped at $0.0196 against a $0.018 ceiling, escalated on the same branch, middle tier passed at $0.170, PR #17 opened unattended. The earlier run is kept in a note.\n- **Empty slots:** \"measured baseline saving\" is gone. The #neatHack links and the public link to the cfo.ai plan are still marked empty.\n- **Version:** stays 0.1.0.\n\nI checked the per-task and total comparison figures against the three ledgers myself. For the escalation run I confirmed only that fly-doom-jev PR #17 exists and is open; its figures are yours. I looked at the page in headless Chrome at 1440 px only, and did not look closely at the new card at phone width.\n\nTell me when it is merged and I'll redeploy to https://tally-agents-pi.vercel.app/ and confirm the live text."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":500,"cache_read_input_tokens":786572,"output_token