{"parentUuid":"4970f772-8434-42a6-b8ee-e9675e62d002","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfxdGZ9DHofUjvf8qPCsR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01R37a4oQ6XwQVDfzjRdhQ6F","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='site/index.html'; h=open(p).read()\na='One task, one run. This run came after the three-pass comparison above, where trace history changed no ceiling.'; assert a in h\nh=h.replace(a,'One task, one run. It is a separate run from the three-pass comparison above, where trace history changed no ceiling.')\nopen(p,'w').write(h)\nEOF\ngit add -A site && git commit -qm \"feat(site): 0.2.0, public business plan link, ceiling set from trace history, refreshed counts\" && git push -q -u origin HEAD 2>&1 | tail -1; gh pr create --base main --title \"feat(site): 0.2.0, public business plan, learned ceiling, refreshed counts\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n- **cfo.ai block (25%):** links the now-public `docs/BUSINESS_PLAN.md`, says the measured comparison table also sits on the cfo.ai plan page, and drops the \"public link: not here yet\" slot.\n- **Version:** `tally-agents` 0.2.0 on npm, with its facts: direct runners, parallel through Agent Orchestrator, trace-driven routing with learned ceilings, evidence links on PRs.\n- **30% block:** new card: on a real run on 12 October Tally set a task's ceiling from neatlogs history (6 similar attempts, all passed, about 1 cent average): $0.0228 where the configured ceiling was $0.30; the task passed at $0.0182. Labelled one task, one run, and separate from the three-pass comparison.\n- **Counts at fdfc743:** 185 of 377 commits carry an Entire checkpoint, 143 merged pull requests, 882 tests.\n- All six limit lines under the comparison are unchanged. The only empty slot left is the #neatHack links.\n\n## Tests\n`cli/site-frames.test.ts` passes; looked at in headless Chrome at 1440 px. Verified by me: the plan file exists on main, npm reports 0.2.0, the commit, checkpoint and merged-PR counts. As supplied, not verified by me: the learned-ceiling run's figures, 882 tests, and that the table is on the cfo.ai page.\n\n## After merge\nRedeploy with `vercel deploy --prod` from `site/`.\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Fix one unverified phrase, commit, push and open the PR","timeout":400000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2524,"cache_read_input_tokens":803988,"output_tokens":1041,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":90},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2524,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1041,"cache_read_input_tokens":803988,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2524,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2524},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01R37a4oQ6XwQVDfzjRdhQ6F":{"command":"cd /Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/worktrees/neatlogs-hack/neatlogs-hack-6 && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='site/index.html'; h=open(p).read()\na='One task, one run. This run came after the three-pass comparison above, where trace history changed no ceiling.'; assert a in h\nh=h.replace(a,'One task, one run. It is a separate run from the three-pass comparison above, where trace history changed no ceiling.')\nopen(p,'w').write(h)\nEOF\ngit add -A site && git commit -qm \"feat(site): 0.2.0, public business plan link, ceiling set from trace history, refreshed counts\" && git push -q -u origin HEAD 2>&1 | tail -1; gh pr create --base main --title \"feat(site): 0.2.0, public business plan, learned ceiling, refreshed counts\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n- **cfo.ai block (25%):** links the now-public `docs/BUSINESS_PLAN.md`, says the measured comparison table also sits on the cfo.ai plan page, and drops the \"public link: not here yet\" slot.\n- **Version:** `tally-agents` 0.2.0 on npm, with its facts: direct runners, parallel through Agent Orchestrator, trace-driven routing with learned ceilings, evidence links on PRs.\n- **30% block:** new card: on a real run on 12 October Tally set a task's ceiling from neatlogs history (6 similar attempts, all passed, about 1 cent average): $0.0228 where the configured ceiling was $0.30; the task passed at $0.0182. Labelled one task, one run, and separate from the three-pass comparison.\n- **Counts at fdfc743:** 185 of 377 commits carry an Entire checkpoint, 143 merged pull requests, 882 tests.\n- All six limit lines under the comparison are unchanged. The only empty slot left is the #neatHack links.\n\n## Tests\n`cli/site-frames.test.ts` passes; looked at in headless Chrome at 1440 px. Verified by me: the plan file exists on main, npm reports 0.2.0, the commit, checkpoint and merged-PR counts. As supplied, not verified by me: the learned-ceiling run's figures, 882 tests, and that the table is on the cfo.ai page.\n\n## After merge\nRedeploy with `vercel deploy --prod` from `site/`.\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Fix one unverified phrase, commit, push and open the PR","timeout":400000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01R37a4oQ6XwQVDfzjRdhQ6F":{"cwd":"/Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/worktrees/neatlogs-hack/neatlogs-hack-6"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"2b5e26fd-7745-4cef-bf04-ccf54add1347","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfxdG3V1phU731gxwqpAM","type":"assistant","uuid":"df6dd29e-b3e3-4b74-8b0f-854a4c2b580c","timestamp":"2026-10-12T16:03:52.020Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/Users/vaibhaav/.ao/data/worktrees/neatlogs-hack/neatlogs-hack-6","sessionId":"62bf8255-2828-4016-bc6c-8d8c4893b1a2"